{"id":"f75f1cdd7f2beead","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-thm-club-intersection-proper.md","title":"Club Intersection Properties","display":"thm-club-intersection-proper — Club Intersection Properties","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-club-intersection-proper","aliases":["58-thm-club-intersection-proper","Club Intersection Theorem","Diagonal Intersection"],"display":"thm-club-intersection-proper — Club Intersection Properties","depends_on":["[[../batch20/58-df-club.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-regular.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-club-intersection-proper"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-club-intersection-proper</span><span>Club Intersection Theorem</span><span>Diagonal Intersection</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-club-intersection-proper — Club Intersection Properties"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"04670bdc8b64b8dd\" href=\"?note=04670bdc8b64b8dd\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-club.md\">../batch20/58-df-club.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d83de8696e4dad26\" href=\"?note=d83de8696e4dad26\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-regular.md\">../batch16/58-df-regular.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> (不可数正则基数)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Reg}\">\\(\\mathrm{Reg}\\)</span> (正则基数谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d83de8696e4dad26\" href=\"?note=d83de8696e4dad26\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-regular.md\">../batch16/58-df-regular.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Club}(C,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Club}(C,\\kappa)\\)</span> (club 谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"04670bdc8b64b8dd\" href=\"?note=04670bdc8b64b8dd\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-club.md\">../batch20/58-df-club.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle C_i:i&lt;\\eta\\rangle\">\\(\\langle C_i:i&lt;\\eta\\rangle\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle C_\\alpha:\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\rangle\">\\(\\langle C_\\alpha:\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\rangle\\)</span> (club 序列)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}club\\text{-}intersection\\text{-}proper}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Reg}(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\\eta&lt;\\kappa\n\\land\\forall i&lt;\\eta\\;\\mathrm{Club}(C_i,\\kappa)\n\\to\\mathrm{Club}\\left(\\{\\beta&lt;\\kappa:\\forall i&lt;\\eta\\;(\\beta\\in C_i)\\},\\kappa\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}club\\text{-}intersection\\text{-}proper}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Reg}(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\\eta&lt;\\kappa\n\\land\\forall i&lt;\\eta\\;\\mathrm{Club}(C_i,\\kappa)\n\\to\\mathrm{Club}\\left(\\{\\beta&lt;\\kappa:\\forall i&lt;\\eta\\;(\\beta\\in C_i)\\},\\kappa\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}club\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}intersection}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Reg}(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\n\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\;\\mathrm{Club}(C_\\alpha,\\kappa)\n\\to\\mathrm{Club}\\left(\n\\{\\beta&lt;\\kappa:\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\beta\\;(\\beta\\in C_\\alpha)\\},\\kappa\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}club\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}intersection}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Reg}(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\n\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\;\\mathrm{Club}(C_\\alpha,\\kappa)\n\\to\\mathrm{Club}\\left(\n\\{\\beta&lt;\\kappa:\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\beta\\;(\\beta\\in C_\\alpha)\\},\\kappa\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>More generally, intersections of fewer than <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> club subsets of a regular <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> are club.</li>\n<li>The bounded comprehension also covers <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta=0\">\\(\\eta=0\\)</span>, when the intersection is the whole carrier <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>, without applying a nonempty-family intersection operator to the empty family.</li>\n<li>For a sequence <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle C_\\alpha : \\alpha &lt; \\kappa \\rangle\">\\(\\langle C_\\alpha : \\alpha &lt; \\kappa \\rangle\\)</span> of club subsets, the diagonal intersection <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{\\alpha &lt; \\kappa} C_\\alpha\">\\(\\Delta_{\\alpha &lt; \\kappa} C_\\alpha\\)</span> is club.</li>\n<li>These closure properties underlie the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-completeness of the club filter.</li>\n<li>Club filter is the &quot;measure&quot; on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> for stationary sets.</li>\n<li>Stationary = positive measure (not in club filter complement).</li>\n<li>Fodor uses diagonal intersection.</li>\n<li>Club filter is not an ultrafilter (unless <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> measurable).</li>\n<li>Foundation for: saturation of ideals, generic ultrapowers.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch20/58-df-club.md","status":"resolved","id":"04670bdc8b64b8dd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-club.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-regular.md","status":"resolved","id":"d83de8696e4dad26","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-regular.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-regular.md","status":"resolved","id":"d83de8696e4dad26","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Reg}$ (正则基数谓词, see [[../batch16/58-df-regular.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-club.md","status":"resolved","id":"04670bdc8b64b8dd","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Club}(C,\\kappa)$ (club 谓词, see [[../batch20/58-df-club.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Reg}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Club}(C,\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle C_i:i<\\eta\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle C_\\alpha:\\alpha<\\kappa\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}club\\text{-}intersection\\text{-}proper}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Reg}(\\kappa)\\land\\omega<\\kappa\\land\\eta<\\kappa\n\\land\\forall i<\\eta\\;\\mathrm{Club}(C_i,\\kappa)\n\\to\\mathrm{Club}\\left(\\{\\beta<\\kappa:\\forall i<\\eta\\;(\\beta\\in C_i)\\},\\kappa\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}club\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}intersection}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Reg}(\\kappa)\\land\\omega<\\kappa\n\\land\\forall\\alpha<\\kappa\\;\\mathrm{Club}(C_\\alpha,\\kappa)\n\\to\\mathrm{Club}\\left(\n\\{\\beta<\\kappa:\\forall\\alpha<\\beta\\;(\\beta\\in C_\\alpha)\\},\\kappa\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle C_\\alpha : \\alpha < \\kappa \\rangle","display":false},{"t